{"seq":3,"slug":"input-model","title":"输入模型：把按键抽象成可计算的事件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-input-buffering-systems/foundations/input-model","wordCount":1551,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"输入模型-把按键抽象成可计算的事件\">输入模型：把按键抽象成可计算的事件</h1><p>要缓冲一个输入，先得能精确地表示它。「玩家按了跳跃」这句话在代码里其实藏着好几个不同的东西：是这一帧按下的瞬间，还是持续按住的状态？是物理按键，还是映射后的动作？发生在哪一帧？这些区别在没有缓冲时可以糊弄过去，一旦要把输入存进队列、比较时间戳、判定过期，就必须把它们拆清楚。本篇给出全 hub 通用的输入模型词汇表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-采集-轮询与事件两种视角\">核心概念：采集，轮询与事件两种视角</h2><p>游戏读取输入有两条路。**轮询（polling）**在每帧主动查询设备当前状态：这一帧摇杆在哪、哪些键正被按住。**事件（event）**则由系统在状态变化时推送一条消息：某键在某时刻被按下、被抬起。二者各有取舍——轮询与主循环天然同步、实现简单，但只能看到「帧边界上的快照」，两帧之间发生又消失的按键会被漏掉；事件保留了帧内的时序与顺序，却需要一个队列去承接，并要小心时间戳与游戏时钟的对齐。</p>\n<p>对缓冲系统而言，这个区别至关重要：<strong>缓冲本质上是事件思维</strong>。要缓冲一个「早到」的按键，你必须记住它「何时」发生，而不只是「现在是否按住」。因此即便底层用轮询采集，缓冲层也要在检测到状态变化的那一帧，把它转化为一条带时间戳的事件。设备如何抽象、轮询与事件如何选型，是上游 <a href=\"../../game-input-systems/foundations/polling-vs-events\">45_game-input-systems</a> 的主题；本 hub 只关心转化之后的事件如何被暂存与判定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[物理设备] --&gt; B[采集层]&#10;  B --&gt; C{轮询快照 or 事件流}&#10;  C --&gt;|轮询| D[本帧状态: 按住/未按]&#10;  C --&gt;|事件| E[状态变化消息]&#10;  D --&gt; F[边沿检测&lt;br/&gt;与上帧比较]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[press 按下沿]&#10;  F --&gt; H[release 抬起沿]&#10;  F --&gt; I[hold 保持]&#10;  G --&gt; J[生成带时间戳输入事件&lt;br/&gt;投入缓冲队列]&#10;  H --&gt; J\">flowchart TD\n  A[物理设备] --&gt; B[采集层]\n  B --&gt; C{轮询快照 or 事件流}\n  C --&gt;|轮询| D[本帧状态: 按住/未按]\n  C --&gt;|事件| E[状态变化消息]\n  D --&gt; F[边沿检测&lt;br/&gt;与上帧比较]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[press 按下沿]\n  F --&gt; H[release 抬起沿]\n  F --&gt; I[hold 保持]\n  G --&gt; J[生成带时间戳输入事件&lt;br/&gt;投入缓冲队列]\n  H --&gt; J</pre><h2 id=\"边沿检测-按下-抬起-保持\">边沿检测：按下、抬起、保持</h2><p>原始状态只有「按住」与「未按」两种，但玩法关心的是<strong>变化的瞬间</strong>。把本帧状态与上帧状态比较，就得到三种边沿：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>按下沿（press / pressed）</strong>：上帧未按、本帧按住——这是绝大多数动作触发的时机（跳一次、攻击一次）。</li>\n<li><strong>抬起沿（release / released）</strong>：上帧按住、本帧未按——用于蓄力松开、可变跳跃高度（松开越早跳越低）。</li>\n<li><strong>保持（hold / held）</strong>：本帧按住，无论上帧如何——用于持续动作（瞄准、加速、格挡）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>用逻辑式表达，设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 帧的按住状态（真为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>pressed</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∧</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mtext>released</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∧</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mtext>held</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{pressed}_t = s_t \\wedge \\neg s_{t-1}, \\quad \\text{released}_t = \\neg s_t \\wedge s_{t-1}, \\quad \\text{held}_t = s_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pressed</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7056em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">released</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7056em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">held</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>缓冲系统缓冲的几乎总是<strong>边沿</strong>而非状态——你不会去缓冲「保持」（它本来就持续存在），你缓冲的是那个转瞬即逝的「按下沿」，因为正是它容易和某个判定帧错开。把边沿检测独立成一层，是让缓冲、土狼时间、取消窗口能共用同一份输入表示的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"负边沿-一个经典而危险的技巧\">负边沿：一个经典而危险的技巧</h2><p>有一类特殊用法值得单列：<strong>负边沿（negative edge）</strong>，即用「抬起」而非「按下」来触发动作。它源自早期街机格斗游戏——玩家搓完招式指令的最后一步若已按住某键，松开时也能出招，等于给出招多了一次判定机会，扩大了容错。</p>\n<p>但负边沿是宽容与误触发张力（见<a href=\"responsive-vs-forgiving\">响应与宽容之衡</a>）的一个典型放大器。因为松手是极其自然的动作，负边沿会把大量本无出招意图的松手也解读成指令。正因如此，《街头霸王 6》（Street Fighter 6，2023）在标准操作下把负边沿默认关闭，玩家可自行开启——官方的顾虑正是它与本就相当宽松的输入缓冲叠加后，太容易搓出玩家没打算出的招（据 EventHubs 与玩家社区讨论）。这给我们一个通用教训：任何扩大宽容的机制都要问一句「它会不会把自然、无意的操作也算成指令」，负边沿是这个问题最锋利的例子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一条输入事件该带什么\">一条输入事件该带什么</h2><p>综合以上，缓冲队列里的一条输入事件至少需要这几个字段。它们决定了后面能做什么样的判定。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>action</td>\n<td>映射后的动作标识（如 Jump、Attack）</td>\n<td>与游戏逻辑解耦，避免绑死物理键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>edge</td>\n<td>press / release</td>\n<td>区分触发时机，支持负边沿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>timestamp</td>\n<td>发生的帧号或游戏时间</td>\n<td>判定是否过期、比较先后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>value</td>\n<td>模拟量（摇杆方向、扳机深度）</td>\n<td>支持方向输入与压感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>consumed</td>\n<td>是否已被消费</td>\n<td>防止一个输入被执行多次</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中 <code>timestamp</code> 与 <code>consumed</code> 是缓冲的灵魂：前者让「时间窗过期」可计算（<a href=\"../buffering/buffer-windows\">缓冲时间窗</a>），后者防止误触发里最常见的「一次按键触发两次」。<code>action</code> 字段则体现一条纪律——<strong>缓冲发生在映射之后</strong>：你缓冲的是「跳跃」这个意图，而不是「空格键」这个物理事实，这样重绑定、多设备才不会破坏缓冲逻辑。动作映射本身属于 <a href=\"../../game-input-systems/mapping/action-mapping\">45_game-input-systems</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>采集有轮询与事件两种视角，但缓冲本质是事件思维：必须记住输入「何时」发生，故即使底层轮询，也要在变化帧转化为带时间戳事件。</li>\n<li>边沿检测把状态差分成按下沿、抬起沿、保持三种；缓冲缓冲的几乎总是转瞬即逝的「按下沿」，独立成层让各机制共用同一表示。</li>\n<li>负边沿用松手触发以扩大容错，但会把自然的松手误判为指令，SF6 因此默认关闭——凡扩大宽容的机制都须自问是否会吞并无意操作。</li>\n<li>一条输入事件至少含 action / edge / timestamp / value / consumed；timestamp 支撑过期判定、consumed 防重复触发，且缓冲应发生在动作映射之后。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章前篇：<a href=\"why-input-buffering\">为何输入缓冲</a>、<a href=\"responsive-vs-forgiving\">响应与宽容之衡</a>（本 hub 兄弟篇）</li>\n<li>直接后继：<a href=\"../buffering/input-queue\">输入队列</a> 用这套事件模型搭数据结构（本 hub 兄弟篇）</li>\n<li>跨库：轮询与事件的采集选型，见 <a href=\"../../game-input-systems/foundations/polling-vs-events\">45_game-input-systems / 轮询与事件</a>；动作映射，见 <a href=\"../../game-input-systems/mapping/action-mapping\">45_game-input-systems / 动作映射</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"输入模型：把按键抽象成可计算的事件","id":"输入模型-把按键抽象成可计算的事件"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：采集，轮询与事件两种视角","id":"核心概念-采集-轮询与事件两种视角"},{"level":2,"text":"边沿检测：按下、抬起、保持","id":"边沿检测-按下-抬起-保持"},{"level":2,"text":"负边沿：一个经典而危险的技巧","id":"负边沿-一个经典而危险的技巧"},{"level":2,"text":"一条输入事件该带什么","id":"一条输入事件该带什么"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"响应与宽容之衡：一根张力轴上的两端","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-input-buffering-systems/foundations/responsive-vs-forgiving"},"next":{"title":"输入队列：缓冲系统的承载体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-input-buffering-systems/buffering/input-queue"}}